<view class="page"><view class="title">欢迎回到校园拾集</view><view class="subtitle">登录后发布闲置，管理你的校园好物</view><view class="panel section"><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="login" data-mode="wechat">微信登录</button><view class="safe-note">登录身份与学生实名认证分别校验，认证通过后开放发布权限。</view></view><view wx:if="{{demoEnabled}}" class="panel"><view class="section-title">课堂演示登录</view><view class="field"><picker range="{{accounts}}" range-key="name" value="{{selected}}" bindchange="choose"><view class="picker">{{accounts[selected].name}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><input password placeholder="输入本地演示密码" value="{{password}}" bindinput="input"/></view><button class="secondary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="login" data-mode="demo">使用演示身份</button><view class="safe-note">使用虚构身份体验认证和发布流程。</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view></view>
